      "text": "Plurai Simulation is the #1 Product of the Day on Product Hunt 🏆\n\nThousands of builders showed up, not just to test their agents, but to break them on purpose, before their users do.\n\nBecause agents don't fail in the demo. They fail on the 10,000th conversation, in the case https://t.co/k5BhOuojys",
