      "text": "Friend's Agent got dumber overnight. No code change, no prompt change. Output crashed.\n\nHe blamed prompt drift, tuned 3 days, worse.\n\nCheck relay. It was not the model he bought. Quantized, cut version, same API name. No way to tell from outside.\n\nRelay said vendor updated. https://t.co/ybSW8cLTpc",
      "url": "https://x.com/lovezihuatanejo/status/2121201070487535982"
